# Yarlyn Amberstill's rabbits at Amberstill Ranch.
# Sources: items.json / npcs.json (vendor, Snowshoe; the new Arctic and Brown
# crates); Forever client 1.60.1.70338 via wago.tools (ItemSparse prices; every pet item
# teaches its companion when used).

step Yarlyn Amberstill
  tip Yarlyn Amberstill stands at Amberstill Ranch, east of Kharanos. Each rabbit crate costs 20s; the Arctic and Brown crates are new in Forever. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards.
  vendor 1263                         -- Yarlyn Amberstill
  buy 8497 npc 1263 optional          -- Rabbit Crate (Snowshoe), 20s
  buy 280797 "Rabbit Crate (Arctic)" npc 1263 optional -- 20s
  buy 280801 "Rabbit Crate (Brown)" npc 1263 optional -- 20s
